'''Team Kings''' (Japanese: '''{{j|キングス{{tt|団|だん}}}}''' ''Kings-dan'', literally ''Kings Gang'') is a [[villainous team]] based in the [[Alola]] [[region]]. It appears in the [[Pokémon Horizon]] {{pkmn|manga}}, which is loosely based on {{g|Sun and Moon}}. Their design may have been inspired by [[Team Skull]] and the [[Aether Foundation]], both of which appeared in the games.

